  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Regional Stabilisation Facility for Lake Chad Basin</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Facility&#x2019;s overall objective is to improve the social contract in insurgency-affected areas of the Lake Chad Basin through the following pillars: community security and justice systems established and operational in selected locations; essential social services infrastructure constructed and/or rehabilitated, functional, and accessible; Targeted households provided with livelihood opportunities.</narrative>
  </description>
